WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.440
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.590
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.620
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.290
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.660
How dare you trick us into thinking that we could get our Toys back!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.490
Apologize! If you don't, I'm gonna keep bashing your face!

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:15.730
I'm sorry I lied. So, could you please forgive me?

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.340
Not yet, moron! Next, left foot on green!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.990
That's it! You might actually get taller!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.050
Kokoro-chan, fight!

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.540
Don't call me that!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:31.750
For I, the beautiful genius girl, Akechi Kokoro, graduate of Harvard University, to be put through such a predicament is...

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.420
You reap what you sow, huh?

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.820
She called herself a beautiful girl...

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.060
Then, Green! Red―

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.840
How can the beautiful genius girl, Akechi Kokoro, be tortured like this?!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.720
How long are you gonna play around? We have a case, you know.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.600
Here. A person that went missing in Yokohama Forest.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:59.640
Irene Doala, a second-year student from Yokohama Redbrick Elementary who has been missing since yesterday.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:05.930
It is believed that she got lost in the part of Yokohama Forest that extends behind Holmes Detective Academy while on a school trip.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.680
Yokohama Forest?!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.990
On top of the complicated terrain there,
there used to be an air raid shelter dug into there,

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:17.870
is known for dinosaur fossils being buried there,
has tunnels underneath leading to buried treasure,

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:20.830
and even has stories of gigantic moles and bears living there!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.600
We must rescue her at once! G4, dispatch!

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.680
But before that...

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.880
Good-for-nothings who can't use Toys sufficiently are to stay out of this.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.910
We're worried about Irene-chan too, Kokoro-chan!

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.060
Don't call me that!!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.540
You guys don't have to lift a finger!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.190
Just stay back and watch this beautiful genius girl, Akechi Kokoro, and G4 solve this case!

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.550
Let's go, Tsugiko!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.450
I don't care who's in my way; I will bust through them all!!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:48.830
Hold it!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.920
Wait!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.580
Please wait...

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.750
Ahh, wait for me!

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:54.920
No way...

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.300
I beg you!

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.970
My daughter Irene is timid, yet curious, cute, and a distinguished student!

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.510
Cute and a distinguished student!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:12.770
Please save her... please save her... please save her―

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.060
Shut up!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.190
He's annoying, so throw him in jail.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.630
Also, tie them to a tree.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.100
Are you okay?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.070
Just a little more...

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:21.860
Keep going...

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.380
Now, let's start the investigation.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.630
Let's find her right away.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:26.260
Yes.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.030
We've got to find her before it gets dark...

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.490
Untie us! Hey, Akechi!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.500
We said we'd help you out!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.760
Ouch...

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.460
Now that it's come to this, I gotta chew them off!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.160
This is...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.050
Could this be...

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.640
Me too!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:49.510
Yummy!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.700
Irene-chan!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.670
If you're there, answer us!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:00.840
She's not here...

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:01.720
Cordelia.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:07.070
How about you use your Toys? If you strengthen your senses, you might be able to feel something.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:12.770
I'll give it a try.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.440
Oh eyes, ears, nose...

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:21.840
See the hidden one... listen to the sound she makes...

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:27.040
Draw for me the scents she has left behind... and taste, feel her fluctuations in the air...

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.970
What's that? Sounds like a chant...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.770
This gets me in the mood.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.750
Mood?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:39.040
Ah, once I listened to that chant, I remembered a hand-to-hand technique taught to me by my grandfather!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.270
Its name...

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.310
Baritsu!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.170
That doesn't matter now, does it?!

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.550
Well, how is it?

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.230
Guess you didn't feel anything...

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.470
Wait!

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:50.420
I feel it...

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.450
Is it Irene-chan?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:58.200
What could this be... this is a long breath... hot... smelly like a beast...

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.630
Just like... a bear...

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.130
It's a bear!!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:13.970
See?

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:16.680
Don't be afraid.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.810
Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.110
You're just frightened.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.580
Sher!

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.680
That hurt!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.440
Eh? Where is this place?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:41.320
Cordelia-san! Nero! Herc-san!

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.960
Where could everyone have gone?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.840
A big mouse!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.940
You're going to show me the way?!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.310
So you're guiding me to where everyone is, eh?

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.900
I've heard of these before...

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:29.260
These mice-like creatures called lemmings jump en masse into a dream-like world in times of crisis.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.660
That must be where everyone's...!

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.550
Everyone!!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.010
Waterfall!!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:44.480
Turn around!!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.400
I'm save-

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.560
I guess the radar really doesn't work...

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.330
Then we'll just have to search with our eyes! Let's find her, quickly!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.420
Irene-chan, come out!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.770
Are you there? Tell us if you are or aren't―

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.990
Huh? Where's Kokoro?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.870
Where could she have gone?

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:13.970
She's such a handful...

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:16.130
Kokoro...

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.020
Kokoro!

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.380
Kokoro-san!

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:24.230
What is this?! An air raid shelter? Buried treasure? A mole?!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.430
I can't stop! Someone save me!

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.280
What is this?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.780
Dirt mole?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.740
I thought I was a goner...

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.410
Ah, it's Kokoro-chan!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.070
Don't call me that!

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.230
So, why are you here?

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.000
It's not just me!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.020
Kokoro-chan?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:47.420
It's Akechi Kokoro-chan, an elite of the Yokohama city police!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:50.420
You're...!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.090
Irene Doala?!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:56.760
Vexing! A disgrace! An insult! Why'd you have to find her ahead of me?!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:01.300
Well then, Irene-chan, since Kokoro-chan and I are here, you can rest easy!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:06.520
That doesn't sound at all reassuring. Do you even know how to get back?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:09.610
Nope!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.800
You don't know? A lost detective and a lost policeman?

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.290
How reliable.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.770
What?

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:20.030
You're... cute!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.780
There there, no need to worry! Onee-san is here for you!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.120
I'm with you, too!

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.340
Don't treat me like a kid! Let go of me, Sherlock!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.570
Got it!

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.040
She's so stupid and cute!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.420
Genius! Beautiful girl! Not stupid!

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:42.350
IQ of 1300! Skipped grades and graduated from Harvard University!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.680
Well this sucks... now even Kokoro's gone missing...

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.490
Seems like it...

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:52.670
It's gonna get dark soon, and it'll be dangerous to continue further.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.280
I suppose this is it for today's search.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.690
Well this sucks... now even Sher's gone missing...

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.380
Seems like it...

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:03.990
We've gotta return soon, or else we'll make everyone in the rescue team worry...

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:15.770
We've gotta find Sher right away...

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:18.250
It's gonna be hell if the student council president finds out about this...

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.470
We've gotta be stealthy.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.300
Ah, a banana!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.350
Ah... it's been a month...

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.090
Banana...

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:28.030
Hey, you two, now's not the time to be saying that...

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.040
Me first!

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.850
Oh no you don't! That's mine!!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.150
There's a lot of them on the floor!

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:36.900
Wait! Leave some for me too!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.040
Me too!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.150
A blessing from god!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.630
Just as you predicted, Henriette-sama.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.450
As expected of Henriette-sama.

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:54.590
They attempted to go to Yokohama Forest, so we've imprisoned them.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.300
Ah, Prez!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.240
Please save us! We've been locked in!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.640
We have to find Sher and Irene-chan!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:11.420
I shall not. Without Toys, all you lot can do is bring disaster.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:12.400
But Sher's been...!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.380
Yummy! So yummy!

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:20.310
Thank you, Banana God!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.700
I see.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:28.740
So you are thinking that it'll be great if Sherlock and company get lost forever in that forest.

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:30.620
T-That's Henriette-sama for you!

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.460
I love you! My heart's beating so fast! So fucking kinky!!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.230
Amazing! It lit!

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:58.320
I'm in second grade elementary school. This is nothing to me.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:00.940
Is that edible?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.950
Of course! Your Onee-chan knows at least which mushrooms are edible!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.450
You little...!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.430
Were you here since yesterday?

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:12.610
When you are stranded, you shouldn't move around recklessly and just wait for help to arrive.

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:14.150
It's a given!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.130
Actually, isn't that what you'd say to a baby?!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.670
You're so cute, I just had to, Kokoro!

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:21.430
No honorifics?!

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:25.970
It seems like you've got it together, so why did you get lost in this forest?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:30.280
My father's company might be going bankrupt soon.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.820
Now it's suddenly gotten so serious...

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.440
She's such a good daughter to her father!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.440
Heave-ho!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.820
Heave-ho!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.370
Read the atmosphere~

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.330
And this...

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:52.310
Kagome, Kagome,

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.990
the bird in the cage,

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.930
when oh when will you come out?

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:59.750
Err, isn't that a children's song?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:05.390
This song is a verse in a code made in the Warring States Period that uncovers the whereabouts of buried treasure.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.620
I want to save my father's company.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.480
Search for buried treasure?!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:13.410
That's stupid! There's no way you'd be able to find it!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.140
I've deciphered the code.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.480
You found it?

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.320
Whoa, she's amazing...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.110
But...

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:27.690
If I can't ready the money by tomorrow, the company will...

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:31.060
That's why I need to get out of this forest, no matter what!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.540
Got it, Irene-chan.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.420
I've actually heard that you should stay in one place when you're stranded.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.980
That's what Irene said earlier.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.130
It'll be fine! I'll be sure to bring you back by tomorrow!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.750
Where are you getting that confidence?!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.910
Even though you have no Toys...

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:49.240
Even without Toys, everyone is there for us!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.470
Cordelia-san, Nero, and Herc-san too!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.140
They'll be sure to find us!

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.510
Don't look down on Milky Holmes!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:57.740
Bananawesome!

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.320
Banana Heaven!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:01.020
Bana-... Banana!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.980
Heh, I'm not so sure of that.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.590
It'll be fine! It'll definitely be fine!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.770
Fine. Guess I'll believe you for now.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:08.740
Thanks!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.160
She said "for now," you know.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.240
Looks like they're grilled. Let's eat.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.470
There.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:14.950
Thanks.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.150
Here.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:22.020
Thanks! Itadakimasu!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.530
I'll eat lots and grow big for sure!!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.970
Gimme the next one! Hurry it up!!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.070
Kokoro... so cute...

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:55.040
Don't worry about a thing! I'll definitely protect you.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.750
Leave this to Sherlock Onee-chan!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.170
K-Kokoro-chan...

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.140
So, where are we headed?

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:16.230
South. We can get out to the sea near Yokohama City.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.330
Which way's south?

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:18.770
This way!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.620
How do you know?

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.520
The detective's intuition I have!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.470
Intuition...?

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:24.230
South is this way.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:25.830
Eh? Why?

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:30.200
As long as I have my watch, I can tell the directions. It's common knowledge when you're stranded.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:30.760
Let's go.

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.190
Yes, Captain Irene!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.660
We're not saving her; we're being saved by her, aren't we?!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.250
P-Please wait for us...

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:54.850
I'm exhausted...

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.250
Kokoro-chan, pull yourself together!

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:00.060
One second.

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.840
Don't call me that...

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:08.790
This isn't the time to be playing around. It's gonna get dark soon.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.630
If that happens, Father's company will...

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.670
But I'm tired!

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.090
Kokoro, even if you're petite and cute, I'll still get mad!

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:16.160
Why don't you? I don't wanna walk anymore!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.490
I'm tired! I wanna take a shower! I'm sleepy! I wanna change! I wanna eat chocolate! And bananas too! I'm hungry!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.360
You're right, I'm hungry too...

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:26.090
I wanna eat a banana...

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.010
You're still good to go, Irene-chan?

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:30.920
Irene-chan?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.260
What's wrong?

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.600
We're sorry, Irene-chan.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.840
We didn't notice your feeli-

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.180
Banana?!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.770
No wonder you were the only one that was so lively! Give me!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.130
Me too, please!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:50.870
This is the last one that was left from my school trip. What should we do?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:54.700
Onee-tama! Kokoro wants to eat the banana!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:56.840
Ahh, so cute!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.680
Banana!!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.530
It's a bear!!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:06.330
That was yummy!

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:14.130
Scary!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.690
It's coming this way!

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.050
Save us!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.330
I'll protect the both of you!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.480
See, it's not sca-

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.280
You're only frighte-

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:30.690
Sherlock!

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:03.130
G-Gimme three minutes...

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.480
Ahh, didn't you just say that was the last one you had?!

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:10.090
Thanks, Irene-chan!

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:11.070
You're so...

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:11.820
You okay?

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:17.530
He's pretty good. But I still have <i>that.</i>

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.610
That?

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.270
A hand-to-hand technique taught to me by my grandfather.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.240
Its name is...

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:28.540
That's right, I'm going to defeat this bear. That's why I'll need your help.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:30.290
I can't do this alone.

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.090
Give me both of your hands.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.630
Be serious here.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.430
I ate the rope from the time you had me tied.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:54.940
Pulse!

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:05.580
Sher... you're dead meat...

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.230
A-Amazing...

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:50.030
Yay! We used it! We really used it! Baritsu! Baritsu!!

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:55.330
We said "Pulse!" And how was that a hand-to-hand technique? You said you ate the rope!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.890
Don't worry about the small stuff!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.210
Hey!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:02.620
What were you doing?! You're late!

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:09.320
So you came for me, Cordelia-san, Nero, Herc-san! I believed in you!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:13.040
Cordelia-san! Nero! Herc-san!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.700
Now Father's company won't have to go bankrupt.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.490
Irene...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.660
It's time. Get out.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.860
Irene!!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:33.950
Don't cry.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.020
This is...!

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:43.030
Well, Irene's been safely found, and their company escaped bankruptcy... case closed!

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:46.030
That's right. The bear was driven away.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:46.860
Baritsu?

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:49.670
No. Apparently it was the explosion from an unexploded bomb.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.660
Eh, really?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.910
What's up?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:53.640
Nothing...

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:56.390
Guess I'll go take a nap...

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:57.930
I'm gonna take a bath.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.130
Where's Kokoro?

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.120
She's probably off playing somewhere again, isn't she?

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.870
<i>Irene-chan stole something very important.</i>

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.340
<i>It was our Kokoro-san.</i>

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.410
<i>It was our Kokoro-san.</i>

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.560
Eh? There's a banana peel here...

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.790
Oh, here too!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:23.010
They'll be handy when we need them, huh?
Cordelia-san and the others might want them, too!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.800
Ah, banana...

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:30.210
So mean... I can't believe you!

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:33.250
So you don't give a damn about me, do you?!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.900
It's not what you think, Sher!

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:35.760
It's a misunderstanding!

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.420
T-That's right, this is just a...

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.510
At least...

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:43.910
...you could have left one for me to eat!!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.400
Sher!!

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.200
Where did Kokoro go?

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:22.510
Who knows. Isn't she just playing somewhere?

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:25.740
Kokoro-san's turned into a star.

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:30.060
We'll have to continue working hard not as G4, but as G3, eh?

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:31.600
G3?!

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:34.490
Message from headquarters, we'll be working on an abduction case.

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:35.080
Abduction?!

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:35.700
Who's the victim?

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:37.470
It was Kamaboko.

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:40.810
The cat that Milky Holmes owns?

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:43.660
Next Time: A Case of the Missing Kamaboko.

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:46.100
The culprit is me! And I have no idea why!
